---
description: Performance rules for websites
globs: ["**/*.tsx", "**/*.ts", "**/*.jsx", "**/*.js", "public/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Prefer small bundles and native browser features.
- Avoid shipping oversized images, duplicate fonts, or blocking scripts.
- Favor CSS and HTML solutions before JavaScript-heavy interactions.
- When adding assets, keep filenames and loading strategy sane.
